Bestiary: {
	VampireMiner: A miner who never left the caves, and now hungers for more than ore.
	ShadowMummy: The cursed sands of the Corruption bind the restless dead to shadow, silencing the living who wander near.
	SpectralMummy: Hallowed light has woken these mummies, and its glow leaves travelers dazed and confused.
	ShadowHammer: A hammer steeped in dark magic that spins itself up and lunges through the stone of the Corruption.
	SpectralElemental: A chaos elemental touched by spirits of light, slow to move but dangerous to stand near.
	DragonHornet: A larger, armored relative of the common hornet that fires its stingers from deep in the jungle.
	DragonSnatcher: A hardier snatcher that clamps down on anything that wanders too close to its roots.
	DragonSkull: A skull larger than the cursed ones, with a bite that can leave victims unable to use their items.
	AlbinoAntlion: A pale antlion that buries itself in the sand and spits sand at anything passing overhead.
	ArchDemon: A battle-hardened demon that rules the Underworld skies with volleys of spinning blades.
	ArchWyvern: A massive bronze wyvern that patrols the sky and tears through blocks to reach its prey.
	ShadowSlime: A slime stained dark by the Corruption that breaks apart into smaller slimes when it dies.
	SpectralGastropod: A gastropod that glows with spirit light and fires bolts of energy from within its shell.
}

